---
description: "How to summarize work and report changes"
alwaysApply: true
---

- End every response with a **short, plain-language summary** of what changed — no jargon dump, a few sentences max.
- Always list every file created, modified, or deleted in that response, as a simple list.
- When a multi-step task finishes, give one consolidated list of every file touched across the whole task, not just the last step.
